# Creativity is Engineering

This is a standard repo in the ship-standard shape.

- Answer only: did this insight become a citable law?
- Cite gate ids (`MOAT-1`, `PACK-3`). Do not cite heading text.
- No timing → do not optimize "slow" (`MEASURE-5`).
- If the operator names an advantage, lock it (`MOAT-1`). Do not "fix" it.
- One failure kind → one action (`TAX-2`).
- Chat insights must land in `dimensions/` or `examples/` in the same change (`LAND-2`).
- First commit on a new dimension makes `npm run verify` red, then green.
- Launch / STOP / rollback questions go to ship-standard, not here.
